  "job_B14.26_20251003_114307": {
    "text": "Anno MXIIII ab incarnatione Domini nostri Iesu Christi.\n\u00deis is an \u00f0ara ger\u00e6dnessa, \u00fee Engla cyningc gedihte mid his witena ge\u00feeahte.\n\u00de\u00e6t is \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t he wile, \u00fe\u00e6t ealle Godes circan beon fulles gri\u00f0es wur\u00f0e.\nAnd gif \u00e6fre \u00e6nig man heonan for\u00f0 Godes ciricgri\u00f0 swa abrece, \u00fe\u00e6t he binnon ciricwagum mansleaga\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6t is \u00feonne \u00e6rest, \u00fe\u00e6t he his agenne wer gesille \u00feam cyninge & Christe & mid \u00feam hine silfne\nFor\u00f0am Cristen cyning is Cristes gespelia on Cristenre \u00feeode; and he sceal Cristes abilg\u00f0e wrecan\nAnd gif hit \u00feonne to bote gega, & se cyngc \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feafige, \u00feonne bete man \u00fe\u00e6t ciricgri\u00f0 into \u00f0are circan\nAnd gif be cwicum mannum ciricgri\u00f0 abrocen beo, betan man georne be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy, sy hit \u00feurh\nNe syn ealle cyrcan na gelicre m\u00e6\u00f0e worldlice wir\u00f0e, \u00feeah hi godcundlice habban halgunge gelice.\nHeafodmynstres gri\u00f0bryce \u00e6t botwur\u00f0an \u00feingan bete man be cyninges munde, \u00fe\u00e6t is mid V pundum\nA sceal mid rihte dom \u00e6fter d\u00e6de & medmung be m\u00e6\u00fee.\nAnd be teo\u00f0unge se cyng & his witan habba\u00f0 gecoren & gecweden, ealswa hit riht is, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00f0riddan d\u00e6l\nAnd wite Cristenra manna gehwilc, \u00fe\u00e6t he his Drihtene his teo\u00feunge, a swa seo sulh \u00feone teo\u00f0an \u00e6cer\n\u00d0\u00e6t is: Gif hwa teo\u00feunge rihtlice gel\u00e6stan nelle, \u00feonne fare to \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges gerefa & \u00fe\u00e6s mynstres\nAnd sy \u00e6lc geogu\u00f0e teo\u00f0ung gel\u00e6st be pentecosten be wite; and eor\u00f0westma be emnihte o\u00f0\u00f0e huru be\nAnd Romfeoh gel\u00e6ste man \u00e6ghwilce geare be Petres m\u00e6ssan.\n& se \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6t nelle gel\u00e6stan, sille \u00fear to eacan XXX p\u00e6niga & gilde \u00feam cyninge CXX scillinga.\nAnd ciricsceat gel\u00e6ste man be Martinus m\u00e6ssan.\n& se \u00fee \u00f0\u00e6t ne gel\u00e6ste, forgilde hine mid twelffealdan, & \u00feam cyninge CXX scillinga.\nSulh\u00e6lmessan gebire\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t man gel\u00e6ste be wite \u00e6ghwilce geare, \u00feonne XV niht beo\u00f0 agan ofer\n& leohtgescot gel\u00e6ste man to candelm\u00e6ssan; do oftor se \u00f0e wille.\nAnd sawlsceat is rihtast, \u00fe\u00e6t man symle gel\u00e6ste a \u00e6t openum gr\u00e6fe.\nAnd ealle Godes gerihta fir\u00f0rige man georne, ealswa hit \u00feearf is.\nAnd gif hwa \u00fe\u00e6t nelle, gewilde man hine to rihte mid worldlicre steore; & \u00fe\u00e6t si gem\u00e6ne Criste &\nAnd freolsa & f\u00e6stena be wite healde man rihtlice.\nAnd Sunnondaga cypinga forbeode man georne be fullan worldwite.\nAnd weofod\u00feena m\u00e6\u00f0e medemige man for Godes ege.\nGif man m\u00e6ssepreost tihtlige, \u00fee regollice libbe, andfealdre spr\u00e6ce, m\u00e6ssige, gif he durre, & ladige\nGif man diacon tihtlige, \u00fee regollice libbe, andfealdre spr\u00e6ce, nime twegen his gehadan & ladige hine\nAnd gif man hine tihtlige \u00feryfealdre spr\u00e6ce, nime six his gehadan & ladige mid \u00feam & beo he silf\nGif man folciscne m\u00e6ssepreost mid tihtlan belecge, \u00fee regollif n\u00e6bbe, ladige hine swa swa diacon, \u00fee\nGif man freondleasne weofod\u00feen mid tihtlan belecge, \u00fee adfultum n\u00e6bbe, ga to corsn\u00e6de, & \u00fear \u00feonne\nAnd gif man gehadodne mid f\u00e6h\u00f0e belecge & secge, \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6re d\u00e6dbana o\u00f0\u00f0e r\u00e6dbana, ladige mid\nAnd gif he sy m\u00e6gleas, ladige mid geferan o\u00f0\u00f0e f\u00e6ste to corsn\u00e6de, & \u00fear\u00e6t gefare \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t God r\u00e6de.\nAnd ne \u00feearf \u00e6nig mynstermunuc ahwar mid rihte f\u00e6h\u00f0bote biddan ne f\u00e6h\u00f0bote betan: he g\u00e6\u00f0 of his\nGif m\u00e6ssepreost manslaga wur\u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0e elles manweorc to swi\u00f0e gewurce, \u00feonne \u00feolige he \u00e6g\u00f0res ge\nGif m\u00e6ssepreost ahwar stande on leasre gewitnesse o\u00f0\u00f0e on m\u00e6nan a\u00f0e o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00feeofa gewita &\nAnd gif he ladian wille, geladige be d\u00e6de m\u00e6\u00f0e swa mid \u00feryfealdre lade, be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy.\nGif weofod\u00feen be boca t\u00e6cincge his agen lif rihtlice fadige, \u00feonne sy he fulles \u00feegnweres &\nAnd gif he his lif misfadige, wanige his weor\u00f0scipe, be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy.\nWite, gif he wille: ne gebira\u00f0 him nan \u00feingc ne to wife ne to worldwige, gif he Gode wile rihtlice hyran\nAc we l\u00e6ra\u00f0 georne & luflice bidda\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6lces hades men \u00feam life libban, \u00fee heom to gebirige.\n& heonan for\u00f0 we willa\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t abbodas & munecas regollicor libban, \u00feonne hi nu \u00e6r \u00f0isan on\nAnd se cyngc beode\u00f0 eallum his gerefan on \u00e6ghwilcere stowe, \u00fe\u00e6t ge \u00feam abbodan \u00e6t eallum\nAnd gif man gehadodne o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6l\u00feeodigne man \u00feurh \u00e6nig \u00feinc forr\u00e6de \u00e6t feo o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6t feore, o\u00f0\u00f0e hine\nAnd bete man \u00e6g\u00f0er ge him ge \u00feam cynge, swa swa hit gebirige, be \u00feam \u00fee seo d\u00e6d sy, o\u00f0\u00f0e he \u00f0a\nCristenum mannum gebira\u00f0 swi\u00f0e rihte, \u00fe\u00e6t he Godes abilg\u00f0e wrece swi\u00f0e georne.\nAnd wise w\u00e6ran worldwitan, \u00fee to godcundan rihtlagan woroldlaga settan, folce to steore, & Criste &\nAc on \u00feam gemotan, \u00feeah r\u00e6dlice wur\u00f0an on namcu\u00f0an stowan, \u00e6fter Eadgares lifdagum, Cristes lage\nAnd \u00fea man getw\u00e6mde \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6r w\u00e6s gem\u00e6ne Criste & cynincge on worldlicre steore; & a hit wear\u00f0 \u00fee\nAnd git m\u00e6g \u00f0eah bot cuman, wille hit man georne on eornost aginnan.\nAnd gif man eard wille rihtlice cl\u00e6nsian, \u00feonne mot man smeagan & geornlice spirian, hwar \u00f0a\nAc swa hwar swa hi man finde, gewilde hi to rihte \u00feances o\u00f0\u00f0e un\u00f0ances, o\u00f0\u00f0e hi afirsige mid ealle of\nGif munuc o\u00f0\u00f0e m\u00e6ssepreost wi\u00f0ersaca wur\u00f0e mid ealle, he sy amansumod \u00e6fre, buton he \u00fee r\u00e6dlicor\nAnd se \u00fee Godes utlagan ofer \u00feone andagan, \u00fee se cyngc sette, h\u00e6bbe on gewealde, plihte to him\nAc uton don, swa us \u00feearf is: uton niman us to bisnan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6rran worldwitan to r\u00e6de ger\u00e6ddon,\n& utan God lufian innewerdre heortan & Godes laga giman, swa wel swa we betst magon.\nAnd uton rihtne Cristendom geornlice wur\u00f0ian & \u00e6lcne h\u00e6\u00f0endom mid ealle oferhogian.\nAnd uton \u00e6nne cynehlaford holdlice healdan; & freonda gehwilc mid rihtan getriw\u00f0an o\u00f0erne lufige",
